<title>NORWAY: Aker RGI 1996 results per division.</title>
<headline>Aker RGI 1996 results per division.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Operating results per division at Norwegian industrial holding company Aker RGI ASA (RGI) for the twelve months to December 31.</p>
<p>				     (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Scancem (millions Swedish crowns)     1,464     vs     1,299</p>
<p> Aker Maritime				   230     vs	 188</p>
<p> Norway Seafoods		     minus    38     vs	 284</p>
<p> Avantor ASA				     298     vs	  87</p>
<p> Constructor Group				40     vs	  34</p>
<p> Langsten					   82     vs	  88</p>
<p> Brattvaag Industrier		minus     9     vs	  28</p>
<p> Brooks					     15     vs	   2</p>
<p> EMO				     minus    10     vs	   9</p>
<p> Helly-Hansen				    101     vs	  22</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
